# "Second spell each turn": one Pyrite Spellbomb on turn 3 and one on turn 5 are each the first spell of their turn, so the
# Shredder never connives and keeps its cards (no counter; the hand shrinks by exactly the spells and lands played).

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Island
Mox Jet
Ledger Shredder
Pyrite Spellbomb
Pyrite Spellbomb
Island
Island
Island
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ledger Shredder.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#2.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyrite Spellbomb.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Island#1.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Pyrite Spellbomb.Cast
[T5 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Ledger Shredder.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot1.Hand.Count = 3
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
